# Omni - zapzap (actions/zapzap/zapzap_omni.kbd)
**omni + g**        -- Omni Search
**omni + n**        -- New Chat
**omni + lsft + n** -- New Group
**omni + rsft + n** -- New Group
**omni + q**        -- Quit
**omni + 1**        -- Tabs Goto 1
**omni + 2**        -- Tabs Goto 2
**omni + 3**        -- Tabs Goto 3
**omni + 4**        -- Tabs Goto 4
**omni + 5**        -- Tabs Goto 5
**omni + 6**        -- Tabs Goto 6
**omni + 7**        -- Tabs Goto 7
**omni + 8**        -- Tabs Goto 8
**omni + 9**        -- Tabs Goto 9
**omni + ,**        -- Settings
